msgctxt "380"
msgid "How are you holding up? Feet feel any better?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "392"
msgid ""
"Oh, it's you again. Well, these old feet of mine have\r\n"
"thankfully stopped hurting, but I think I'd like to rest\r\n"
"them just a tad more."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "404"
msgid ""
"Eventually, I'll have to wander on over to Suppon Street\r\n"
"looking for Jinsei, so that's that..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "416"
msgid "I see... Don't overdo it out here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "428"
msgid "It turns out Jinsei on Suppon Street... Well, it's gone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "440"
msgid "What...? Are you serious?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "452"
msgid ""
"It looks like they sold it off once the real estate market\r\n"
"started going crazy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "464"
msgid ""
"So you don't know where it went? Do you have any idea how\r\n"
"one would go about finding it, then?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "476"
msgid ""
"Well, I heard it moved over to the <Color:7>Champion "
"District<Color:Default>,\r\n"
"but I can't say for sure."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "488"
msgid ""
"I see... So it's in the Champion District, most likely?\r\n"
"That's a good start."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "500"
msgid ""
"Now, if you do happen to spot Jinsei out there, would you\r\n"
"mind giving this old man a holler?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "512"
msgid "I think I can manage that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "524"
msgid ""
"Thank you kindly. Now, if you don't mind, I think I ought to\r\n"
"rest my weary bones a bit longer."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "536"
msgid ""
"Say, I found Jinsei for you. It's still alive and well in\r\n"
"the Champion District."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "548"
msgid ""
"Is that a fact! Would you mind taking me there, if it's not\r\n"
"too much trouble?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "560"
msgid "Finally... I can lay this old burden to rest..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "572"
msgid "Well, actually... I wasn't planning on heading that way."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "584"
msgid ""
"Understandable. I'm sure you have your reasons for not\r\n"
"wanting to escort an unfamiliar old man."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "596"
msgid "I'll just have to look for it myself, then."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "608"
msgid "I do appreciate your help thus far. This is a good start."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "620"
msgid ""
"Why don't you tell me what's going on before I make my\r\n"
"decision?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "632"
msgid "You're right. There's more to this story than I've let on."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "644"
msgid ""
"It was after the war had ended. We returned to the scorched\r\n"
"wasteland of Tokyo and set up shop in Kamurocho's bustling\r\n"
"black market..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "656"
msgid ""
"We bought up crappy rice from the sticks and started selling\r\n"
"gruel. With barely enough food to go around as it was, we\r\n"
"ended up making a fair bit of money."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "668"
msgid ""
"I bought, he sold. We combined our efforts and it eventually\r\n"
"paid off."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "680"
msgid ""
"But... I betrayed him in the end. I ran off with all our\r\n"
"savings... The money we'd earned together."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "692"
msgid ""
"I was tired of doing things the hard way. So I joined forces\r\n"
"with the other dealers and bought a truck with the money I'd\r\n"
"stolen."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "704"
msgid ""
"I could carry a lot in that old truck of mine... Veggies,\r\n"
"meat... even people."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "716"
msgid ""
"While I was working away, my company grew and grew, until\r\n"
"suddenly it was a huge corporation."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "728"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "740"
msgid ""
"But I was always afraid. My company, my truck, my success...\r\n"
"It all came down to the money I took from my partner."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "752"
msgid ""
"I don't expect him to forgive me. Maybe I'm just trying to\r\n"
"make myself feel better, but... all I want to do is tell him\r\n"
"that I'm sorry."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "764"
msgid "So this is your way of burying the hatchet, huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "776"
msgid ""
"Please, take me there. Take me to Jinsei so I can finally\r\n"
"come clean."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "788"
msgid "All right... You've convinced me. Think you can keep up?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "800"
msgid "I'll do my damnedest!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "824"
msgid ""
"I wish I could go looking for Jinsei myself, but I really\r\n"
"need to rest my poor old legs."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "836"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "848"
msgid ""
"And after I'd made it all the way out to Kamurocho, too...\r\n"
"Bah! Pitiful, is it not? Take it from me, young man⑬don't\r\n"
"get old!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "860"
msgid "Well, actually... I wasn't planning on heading that way."
msgstr ""

